{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788505333781,"sessionID":"ses_f94ccbbd8ffex6r1tm6ai3wHOS","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_9757b2a7927f46f99c1d6041","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n -B3 -A15 \"ModelSettings\" docs/models/index.md | head -60"},"output":"80-1.  Sets the name of an OpenAI model directly.\n81-2.  Provides a [`Model`][agents.models.interface.Model] implementation.\n82-\n83:When you want to further configure the model used for an agent, you can pass [`ModelSettings`][agents.models.interface.ModelSettings], which provides optional model configuration parameters such as temperature.\n84-\n85-```python\n86:from agents import Agent, ModelSettings\n87-\n88-english_agent = Agent(\n89-    name=\"English agent\",\n90-    instructions=\"You only speak English\",\n91-    model=\"gpt-4o\",\n92:    model_settings=ModelSettings(temperature=0.1),\n93-)\n94-```\n95-\n96-## Common issues with using other LLM providers\n97-\n98-### Tracing client error 401\n99-\n100-If you get errors related to tracing, this is because traces are uploaded to OpenAI servers, and you don't have an OpenAI API key. You have three options to resolve this:\n101-\n102-1. Disable tracing entirely: [`set_tracing_disabled(True)`][agents.set_tracing_disabled].\n103-2. Set an OpenAI key for tracing: [`set_tracing_export_api_key(...)`][agents.set_tracing_export_api_key]. This API key will only be used for uploading traces, and must be from [platform.openai.com](https://platform.openai.com/).\n104-3. Use a non-OpenAI trace processor. See the [tracing docs](../tracing.md#custom-tracing-processors).\n105-\n106-### Responses API support\n107-\n","metadata":{"output":"80-1.  Sets the name of an OpenAI model directly.\n81-2.  Provides a [`Model`][agents.models.interface.Model] implementation.\n82-\n83:When you want to further configure the model used for an agent, you can pass [`ModelSettings`][agents.models.interface.ModelSettings], which provides optional model configuration parameters such as temperature.\n84-\n85-```python\n86:from agents import Agent, ModelSettings\n87-\n88-english_agent = Agent(\n89-    name=\"English agent\",\n90-    instructions=\"You only speak English\",\n91-    model=\"gpt-4o\",\n92:    model_settings=ModelSettings(temperature=0.1),\n93-)\n94-```\n95-\n96-## Common issues with using other LLM providers\n97-\n98-### Tracing client error 401\n99-\n100-If you get errors related to tracing, this is because traces are uploaded to OpenAI servers, and you don't have an OpenAI API key. You have three options to resolve this:\n101-\n102-1. Disable tracing entirely: [`set_tracing_disabled(True)`][agents.set_tracing_disabled].\n103-2. Set an OpenAI key for tracing: [`set_tracing_export_api_key(...)`][agents.set_tracing_export_api_key]. This API key will only be used for uploading traces, and must be from [platform.openai.com](https://platform.openai.com/).\n104-3. Use a non-OpenAI trace processor. See the [tracing docs](../tracing.md#custom-tracing-processors).\n105-\n106-### Responses API support\n107-\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"grep -n -B3 -A15 \"ModelSettings\" docs/models/index.md | head -60","time":{"start":1788505333738,"end":1788505333767}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_06b399fe20016HYL9YID3cIXBh","sessionID":"ses_f94ccbbd8ffex6r1tm6ai3wHOS","messageID":"msg_06b3996ec001QlTt19Ij18ynoh"}}
